{"id":"Cab5e0c1fab030f6bb6fe","zh":"城市轨道交通","en":"urban rail transit","domain":"环境振动与轨道减振","definition_zh":"服务城市及相关区域交通需求的轨道交通系统。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":"在地铁上盖建筑的环境振动研究中，指作为振动来源的地铁运输系统，用于考察列车运行对上盖建筑振动的影响。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"Cab5e0c1fab030f6bb6fe","zh":"城市轨道交通","en":"urban rail transit","domain":"环境振动与轨道减振","group_id":"H0eee8dd358a31c59eb82","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"环境振动与轨道减振 · 张小安等（2025）"}],"designations":[{"id":"D740037b384ad813fe682","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"城市轨道交通"},{"id":"D26720190c4c4377feda8","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"urban rail transit"}],"sources":{"P133":{"id":"P133","title":"地铁上盖建筑车致环境振动预测模型及影响因素研究","authors":"张小安,王庞瑞,李姝婷,杨建近,徐磊,张晓芸","year":"2025","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20250090","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"张小安等（2025）","overview_slug":"2025-study-on-the-prediction-of-building-vibration-induced-by-subway-operation-and-influencing-factors"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"S2a8868eb4b8849a85103","source_id":"P133","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"synthesis; parameter combination analysis 地铁运营引起的环境振动问题严重影响城市居民的日常生活、危害地面建筑物寿命以及影响精密仪器设备的正常使用 [1],已成为城市轨道交通研究领域的热点问题 [2−6]。","citations":[{"source_id":"P133","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S80d3774658afa714725f","source_id":"P133","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"在理论研究方面,目前最常采用有限元法对城市轨道交通地下线路的环境振动问题进行研究 [7−10],但由于地下线路的子结构众多,导致传统有限元模型的离散区域大,并且为了提高计算精度还需保证有限单元具有较小的尺寸以及引入人工边界,因此传统有限元法存在计算成本高和效率低的问题。","citations":[{"source_id":"P133","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"C19980d810b7cb8d44593","target_concept_id":"C19980d810b7cb8d44593","target_zh":"参数组合分析","target_en":"parameter combination analysis","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C37dc05dab8977962ba68","target_concept_id":"C37dc05dab8977962ba68","target_zh":"环境振动","target_en":"environmental vibration","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C5bad1be7e79c338aa451","target_concept_id":